WEBVTT

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.160
Ogawa-san...

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:19.830
You really won't let me make a copy?

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:20.890
No.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
It's not like copying it 
will cost you anything.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.100
Even if it doesn't affect the record,

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:31.970
I just get the feeling that copying it will
take away some of the music's magic.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:33.390
Let me borrow it, then.

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:36.010
I absolutely will not do that.

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:39.360
Why don't you go to the store
and buy it yourself?

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:43.770
How am I supposed to do that when
there's no title or credits on the jacket?

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:45.480
Where did you buy it?

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:47.730
I'm not saying.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:57.500
That record is more
precious to me than my life.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:00:59.950
Huh?

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:01.990
The record's gone!

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:05.300
You thief!

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:10.370
Stop right there!

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:18.450
Ow...

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.170
I was just borrowing it.

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:22.640
And you threw a rock at me?
You're horrible.

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:23.550
Enough lies.

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:25.520
Hand it over, thief!

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:27.910
That record is my life!

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.730
I'm not letting you have—

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:18.440
<b>Kobayashi Instruments</b>

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:16.260
I'm sorry. We don't carry
analog players anymore.

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:17.890
I see...

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:23.140
<i>I want to listen to the bittersweet
music on this record right now.</i>

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:27.410
<i>I've finally got it to myself, but I don't 
have anything to play it with!</i>

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.560
<b>New and Imported
Records</b>

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:31.570
<i>Maybe here...</i>

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.060
You want to play a record?

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.270
Please!

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:37.270
Just once is fine!

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:39.890
Where'd you get that record?!

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:41.640
That jacket...

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:44.370
That record was part of the
permanent collection here!

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.110
So you're the one who stole it?!

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:47.070
No!

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:48.600
Then why do you have it?!

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:51.250
That's the only copy of it in Japan!

00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:54.100
That record is more
important to me than my life!

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.750
Give it back, now!

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:56.330
Let go of me!

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:22.740
What would you like?

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.330
An orange juice.

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:25.120
Excuse me...

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:25.950
Yes?

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:28.450
Is that music from the radio?

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:30.100
No, it's a record player.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.750
Well, in that case...

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:34.770
Sure, that's fine.

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:35.890
I appreciate it.

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:30.360
I'm positive...

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:32.900
This is "Paula Bell's Scat!"

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:34.620
This is really it, isn't it, miss?

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.100
You know, this record...

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.500
It was recorded right after she died.

00:06:38.820 --> 00:06:40.000
Do you understand?

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:43.290
It was recorded after
she was already dead!

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:45.970
There's nothing written on the jacket...

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:47.890
Then, suddenly, the music starts,

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:51.200
and you hear bizarre intonation
and disinterested singing...

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:53.560
I heard rumors of its existence, but this...

00:06:53.560 --> 00:06:56.690
This is a song from beyond the grave!

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:07.120
<i>He's after the record!</i>

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.350
Stop!

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:16.990
This is...

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:20.160
Give that record back!

00:07:23.220 --> 00:07:25.490
Do you think you're really hidden?

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:27.880
Wh-What the hell?

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.340
It's a dead body!

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:44.250
You dropped it...

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:45.700
So you don't need it, right?

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:47.700
Then I'll take it.

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:25.940
<b>Used Record</b>

00:08:20.930 --> 00:08:25.940
Collection No. 022

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:30.490
<i>Aristotle.</i>

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.900
<i>Because of his theories, some say that</i>

00:08:32.900 --> 00:08:35.770
<i>whispering in someone's
ears while they sleep</i>

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:39.200
<i>will make the whisperer
appear in those dreams,</i>

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.400
<i>where they can influence the dreamer.</i>

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.070
Saiko-san.

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:44.260
Saiko-san.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:46.590
I have a present for you today.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.700
I don't want it.

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:50.880
Why?

00:08:51.150 --> 00:08:52.670
Kishimoto-kun,

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:55.210
you know about the Aristotle method, right?

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:56.530
Yeah...

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:59.640
I can't believe you'd try it.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.850
Why didn't you just ask me in person?

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:04.210
Sorry.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:06.950
I just wasn't feeling confident.

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:09.820
But I really do like you.

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:11.120
Then...

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:13.820
tell me in person at school tomorrow.

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:15.830
Okay.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:17.350
I promise I will.

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:19.410
So, for now, please take this.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:24.250
Look at you two, showing off.

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:26.890
I was already feeling pretty pissed off...

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:28.980
Who are you?

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:30.720
Let's say I'm...

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:32.320
Jack the Ripper.

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:34.670
And I need you to die!

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.630
Don't!

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:41.460
What a terrible dream...

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.270
The same box from my dream?

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:52.240
But the ring is gone.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:53.960
<i>Later that day,</i>

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:58.210
<i>Kishimoto-kun was found
slashed to death in the street.</i>

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:00.740
<i>No one knows who the killer was.</i>

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:03.410
<i>Kishimoto-kun was killed...</i>

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:07.120
<i>But where did that ring go?</i>

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:10.690
<i>Is the man from my dreams the killer?</i>

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:13.960
<i>After that Aristotle incident,</i>

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:18.100
<i>I had more unpleasant experiences waiting.</i>

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:23.380
Collection No. 038

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:23.380
<b>Town of No Roads</b>

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:26.880
Saiko, just what is your problem?!

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:28.100
You know exactly what!

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:32.070
I want you to stop this freaky behavior!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:36.190
What exactly have we done that's so freaky?

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:40.630
You need to stop peeping into my room!

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:43.790
Why would any of us do that?!

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:46.060
Seriously, stop it!

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:53.200
There are new peepholes...

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.740
I can't relax for a second around them.

00:11:10.970 --> 00:11:13.010
Enough already!

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:17.360
Mom, Dad, come on!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:19.620
You're not even trying to hide it anymore!

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:24.200
<i>Seriously, what are they thinking?</i>

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.210
<i>Well, they can't spy on me now.</i>

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.380
Climbing up to the roof, huh?

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:44.800
Well, I'm not gonna just lie down and take it!

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:57.270
Ow!

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:08.210
Dad...

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:09.780
Is your eye okay?

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:13.110
I've just got a bit of a sty, that's all.

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:17.410
Is your finger okay, Onii-chan?

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:19.840
Sorry I got so mad last night.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:23.510
I just jammed it during P.E yesterday.

00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:25.310
It's not your fault.

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:31.060
<i>No more. I can't take this any longer.</i>

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.230
<i>I'm running away for real this time.</i>

00:12:33.230 --> 00:12:34.500
<i>I know.</i>

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.350
<i>I'll go to my aunt's house.</i>

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:38.190
<i>Aunt Tamae's place...</i>

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:39.840
Weird...

00:12:39.840 --> 00:12:42.060
There's no bus going to Kosato.

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:44.190
Oh, well. I'll just walk.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:56.030
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:57.610
<i>A dead end...</i>

00:12:57.610 --> 00:13:00.000
<i>I'm pretty sure this is the right street, too.</i>

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:04.730
<i>Another one?</i>

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:06.370
<i>More dead ends.</i>

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:08.430
<i>How am I supposed to get there?</i>

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:10.890
<i>Maybe I'll try the main street...</i>

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:31.190
<i>The main street's blocked off 
by some kind of building?</i>

00:13:31.190 --> 00:13:32.040
<i>And...</i>

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:34.540
<i>everyone's wearing masks.</i>

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:37.800
What's the matter, miss?

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:39.420
Are you lost?

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:41.700
Yes...

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:44.550
I was trying to get to 3-Chome, 
Oonishi, in Kosato.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:47.880
I'm headed that way myself.
Let me show you the way.

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:49.760
That'd be a big help.

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:24.210
Excuse me... How far do these buildings go?

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:25.970
All the way.

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:28.490
Your destination, 3-Chome in Oonishi,

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:30.180
is also surrounded by them.

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:31.720
It's near the center, actually.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:40.650
Open up, damn it!

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:41.580
What's wrong?

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:43.370
The people who live here

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:46.120
have closed their front door
and won't open it.

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:47.930
Hey, open up!

00:14:47.930 --> 00:14:49.400
I said open that door!

00:14:49.810 --> 00:14:51.030
Just smash it down!

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:58.510
No! Help!

00:14:58.510 --> 00:15:00.000
Help!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:04.390
Selfish people like you just
cause chaos in this town!

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:05.410
Now you'll pay!

00:15:12.600 --> 00:15:15.380
What's going on with this town?

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:19.850
I'll untie you in a second!

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:24.190
Thank you so much.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.130
You must be from the outside.

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:28.420
Does this happen a lot?

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:30.400
It's been worse than usual lately.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:31.710
Everyone's on edge...

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:35.450
I'd say the lack of privacy
is the main problem.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:36.820
Lack of privacy?

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:41.760
All houses in this town are 
opened up to public traffic.

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:46.160
So people's homes aren't private anymore,

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:48.050
and it's agony.

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:50.760
Anyway, what brings you here, miss?

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:53.360
I wanted to visit my aunt.

00:15:53.360 --> 00:15:55.160
She lives at 3-Chome in Oonishi.

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:56.520
How can I get there?

00:15:56.520 --> 00:15:59.130
If you keep going down the street,
you'll see a river.

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:01.530
Cross the bridge there, and you'll see it.

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:03.150
But it's dangerous.

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:05.440
That's in the town's heart,

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:08.340
and rumor has it some
strange folks live there.

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:09.520
Strange?

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:13.490
There's also a lot of crime, 
and a serial killer on the loose.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:15.010
A serial killer!

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:17.950
But that's all the more reason
to go and help her.

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:21.910
In that case, I'd recommend wearing a mask.

00:16:23.090 --> 00:16:24.920
Thanks. I appreciate it.

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:38.290
<i>This is the river...</i>

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:40.270
<i>I should be close to her house.</i>

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.100
<i>This place is so creepy...</i>

00:16:58.380 --> 00:16:59.620
This is her house!

00:17:00.100 --> 00:17:01.310
Aunt Tamae!

00:17:01.800 --> 00:17:03.030
Open the door!

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:05.090
It's me, Saiko!

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:06.330
Aunt Tamae?

00:17:06.740 --> 00:17:09.540
Oh, Saiko-chan? It's been so long!

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.550
The door's open. Come on in.

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:14.000
Aunt Tamae...

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.170
Oh, Saiko-chan.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:18.580
I've missed you!

00:17:19.170 --> 00:17:21.710
Wh-Where are your clothes?

00:17:22.820 --> 00:17:25.440
What can I say? I've still got it!

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:29.790
I'm amazed you came here alone.

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:32.460
It took me a long time to get
used to how things are now.

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:34.690
It wasn't easy for me, either.

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:37.670
But I was worried about you, 
so I had to find you!

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:39.030
Worried? Why?

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:42.750
How could I not be worried about you 
living in a place like this by yourself?

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.430
What's so funny?

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:49.360
And why are you naked?

00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:50.390
Put something on!

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:52.360
I'm sorry.

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:54.710
But hear me out, okay?

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:57.700
I wasn't sure about it at first, either.

00:17:57.700 --> 00:18:00.480
I even tried to fight it.

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:04.180
I'd close the doors,
hide on the second floor...

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.780
But they just smashed the door in,

00:18:06.780 --> 00:18:10.110
and people would actually come in 
from the roof to the second floor.

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:11.540
And just look around.

00:18:11.540 --> 00:18:14.430
There are holes all over,
from the ceiling to the walls.

00:18:14.430 --> 00:18:17.110
People keep poking peepholes!

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:21.000
Even now they're probably
watching through them!

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:24.270
Trying to maintain my privacy
amid all this was just crazy.

00:18:24.270 --> 00:18:26.960
So I gave up on privacy altogether.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:28.660
You can do the same.

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:31.000
It's not too late.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.430
Come on, Saiko-chan.

00:18:32.430 --> 00:18:35.620
Throw away that mask, 
and take your clothes off.

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:37.340
It's like shedding your skin!

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.710
You don't seem like the same person.

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:41.710
Like I said...

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:43.680
I've shed my skin.

00:18:44.090 --> 00:18:45.010
It's weird.

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:46.840
You're the weird one.

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:48.160
Hi, how's it going?

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:48.640
Hi.

00:18:48.820 --> 00:18:51.570
Oh, never mind. Let's peel an apple.

00:18:51.570 --> 00:18:53.610
They shed their skin, too, you know.

00:18:55.480 --> 00:18:57.520
Aunt Tamae, you're really acting weird.

00:18:58.330 --> 00:19:02.070
I think living here might've driven you crazy.

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:05.500
And they say there's a 
serial killer around here...

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.500
You might say you don't need your privacy,

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.120
but I think you've lost your mind without it!

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:13.540
You don't understand anything!

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:17.620
You're just a child, so stop
yapping and take your clothes off!

00:19:17.620 --> 00:19:20.580
If you won't do it, I'll take them off you!

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:22.390
I'll cut you apart!

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:23.600
Aunt Tamae, stop!

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.640
Hold it!

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:28.140
Somebody catch that little bitch!

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:00.210
What the...

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:18.570
Oh?

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:21.190
It's the young lady from before!

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.530
I was worried about where you ran off to.

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:26.750
Please, tell me how to get out of here!

00:20:26.750 --> 00:20:29.010
I want to leave as soon as possible!

00:20:29.010 --> 00:20:31.500
Very well. Follow me.

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:39.720
This is the river.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.610
Look there.

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:44.670
Those illegal constructions
even cover the river.

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:45.640
Isn't it remarkable?

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.560
That ring...

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:50.840
Is there something about 
it that interests you?

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:52.180
I know.

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:54.310
I'll give it to you as a gift.

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:56.600
It's so strange...

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.780
The ring fits you perfectly.

00:20:59.060 --> 00:21:02.300
And I feel like I've met
you before somewhere.

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:05.390
Do you happen to remember me?

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:07.510
Jack the Ripper!

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:10.690
You're the one who killed
Kishimoto-kun, aren't you?

00:21:10.690 --> 00:21:12.170
Yeah, that's right.

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:14.120
Why did you kill him?!

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:15.870
You should be grateful to your boyfriend.

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:17.390
If he wasn't there,

00:21:17.390 --> 00:21:19.860
I would've sliced you up instead!

00:21:21.350 --> 00:21:23.590
And now, it's your turn!

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:35.020
Aunt Tamae...

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:44.140
Follow the river upstream.

00:21:44.140 --> 00:21:45.700
You'll be out of here soon.

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:48.820
Aunt Tamae! Let's leave together!

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.400
Aunt Tamae!

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:40.020
Collection
